  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "01-n_open",
      "text": "A pen touches paper. One name. Forty seconds later, on the other side of the world... a man grabs his chest, and falls.",
      "file": "01-n_open.mp3",
      "align": "01-n_open.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.51,
      "speech_start": 0.14,
      "speech_end": 9.22,
      "hash": "4bda4651aecb78a3",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-n_open2",
      "text": "Somewhere else, the ground starts to shake. Over the horizon, a wall of giants is walking. Millions of them. And they are not stopping.",
      "file": "02-n_open2.mp3",
      "align": "02-n_open2.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.14,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 9.64,
      "hash": "2216b63141d320dc",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-n_two",
      "text": "Two boys. One decided to kill every criminal on Earth. The other decided to flatten most of it. Tonight... they meet.",
      "file": "03-n_two.mp3",
      "align": "03-n_two.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.12,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 8.58,
      "hash": "d62e9c88cac8712f",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-n_station",
      "text": "Midnight. An empty train station that isn't on any map. Rain on the glass roof. And a clock above the platforms... stopped at twelve.",
      "file": "04-n_station.mp3",
      "align": "04-n_station.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.82,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 9.44,
      "hash": "d83d923484afc341",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-n_light",
      "text": "Light Yagami gets there first. Neat suit. Red tie. The top student in his country. In his bag, there's a black notebook. Write a name in it, picture the face... and that person dies.",
      "file": "05-n_light.mp3",
      "align": "05-n_light.align.json",
      "seconds": 13.51,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 12.88,
      "hash": "ffad8184cebf066f",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-n_eren",
      "text": "Then the far door opens. Eren Yeager. Soaking wet. Long hair tied back. A green cloak. He can turn into a giant fifteen meters tall. And right now, every giant on Earth does what he says.",
      "file": "06-n_eren.mp3",
      "align": "06-n_eren.align.json",
      "seconds": 14.86,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 14.38,
      "hash": "a268bd0e705ae55b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-n_future",
      "text": "That's Eren's other secret. He remembers things that haven't happened yet. Some of tonight, he has already seen.",
      "file": "07-n_future.mp3",
      "align": "07-n_future.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.58,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 7.12,
      "hash": "78251176593d2b04",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-n_rules",
      "text": "So, two rules. Light needs a name and a face. Eren believes the future he saw can't be changed. Remember both. Before the night is over, they're going to collide.",
      "file": "08-n_rules.mp3",
      "align": "08-n_rules.align.json",
      "seconds": 11.91,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 11.5,
      "hash": "77700268811d5f50",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-n_r1",
      "text": "Round one. What's wrong with the world?",
      "file": "09-n_r1.mp3",
      "align": "09-n_r1.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.03,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 2.44,
      "hash": "b55cf28eefa7de83",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "10-n_r1b",
      "text": "For a second, they both nod. Two boys looked at the world, saw that it was broken... and decided they were the ones to fix it. Not a court. Not a government. Them. Alone.",
      "file": "10-n_r1b.mp3",
      "align": "10-n_r1b.align.json",
      "seconds": 12.62,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 12.2,
      "hash": "e39202034afbb612",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-n_agree1",
      "text": "On this... they agree.",
      "file": "11-n_agree1.mp3",
      "align": "11-n_agree1.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.06,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 1.78,
      "hash": "1c2ca7e9964ea1c6",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-n_r2",
      "text": "Round two. How many people are you willing to kill?",
      "file": "12-n_r2.mp3",
      "align": "12-n_r2.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.58,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.14,
      "hash": "59ce100bf024be4e",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-n_r2b",
      "text": "Eren doesn't answer right away. Because his number is so much bigger.",
      "file": "13-n_r2b.mp3",
      "align": "13-n_r2b.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.86,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 4.36,
      "hash": "1da1694b5379b24c",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "14-n_eighty",
      "text": "Eighty percent of humanity. Cities. Farms. Kids who have never heard his name. Crushed under the giants... so his own people can live.",
      "file": "14-n_eighty.mp3",
      "align": "14-n_eighty.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.87,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 10.22,
      "hash": "17c36898a687234c",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "15-n_bag",
      "text": "Light's hand drifts to his bag. To the notebook.",
      "file": "15-n_bag.mp3",
      "align": "15-n_bag.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.66,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 3.12,
      "hash": "a0be5ae95c0f4ae5",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-n_same",
      "text": "Look at what just happened. Light says \"necessary.\" Eren says \"necessary.\" Same excuse. Different size. On this, they agree too. They just won't admit it.",
      "file": "16-n_same.mp3",
      "align": "16-n_same.align.json",
      "seconds": 11.91,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 11.32,
      "hash": "c22a3a6b2b5b1049",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "17-n_r3",
      "text": "Round three. What does the new world look like?",
      "file": "17-n_r3.mp3",
      "align": "17-n_r3.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.34,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 2.84,
      "hash": "d98f4b9de9ceb9df",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "18-n_r3b",
      "text": "And that's the moment Eren's face changes. Because Light just described the thing he hates most.",
      "file": "18-n_r3b.mp3",
      "align": "18-n_r3b.align.json",
      "seconds": 6.45,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 5.96,
      "hash": "8df2400767a69012",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "19-n_break",
      "text": "Light wants to control everyone. Eren wants no one to be controlled... even if he has to crush the world to get there. This is where they break.",
      "file": "19-n_break.mp3",
      "align": "19-n_break.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.14,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 9.56,
      "hash": "c64f7c4441fc8031",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "20-n_r4",
      "text": "Last round. How does your story end?",
      "file": "20-n_r4.mp3",
      "align": "20-n_r4.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.27,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 2.7,
      "hash": "602c7f4fe977929a",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "21-n_r4b",
      "text": "Light can't understand it. Who plans their own defeat? And Eren can't understand Light. Why would anyone want a throne... when it's just a nicer cage?",
      "file": "21-n_r4b.mp3",
      "align": "21-n_r4b.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.55,
      "speech_start": 0.14,
      "speech_end": 9.98,
      "hash": "9666af3aabedf2a0",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "22-n_verdict",
      "text": "So, would they agree? On the problem... yes. On the cure... never. And two people like that can't share one world.",
      "file": "22-n_verdict.mp3",
      "align": "22-n_verdict.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.43,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 8.96,
      "hash": "43893b70d7e757ca",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "23-n_click",
      "text": "Above them, the clock clicks. Twelve o'clock... and one second. The frozen station starts to move.",
      "file": "23-n_click.mp3",
      "align": "23-n_click.align.json",
      "seconds": 8.07,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 7.5,
      "hash": "97e415f58caf558d",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "24-n_write",
      "text": "Light has made up his mind. The world doesn't need a second god. He opens the notebook. He has seen the face. He knows the name.",
      "file": "24-n_write.mp3",
      "align": "24-n_write.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.74,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 9.2,
      "hash": "48aaffbd30a4ca1e",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "25-n_forty",
      "text": "In forty seconds, Eren's heart is supposed to stop. That's the rule of the notebook. It has never failed. Not once.",
      "file": "25-n_forty.mp3",
      "align": "25-n_forty.align.json",
      "seconds": 8.23,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 7.64,
      "hash": "73929b2a93c94b94",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "26-n_collide",
      "text": "Two rules. The notebook says Eren dies tonight. The future says he doesn't. They can't both be true.",
      "file": "26-n_collide.mp3",
      "align": "26-n_collide.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.58,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 7.14,
      "hash": "04f4d5dbe139ee50",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    }
  ]
}
